SUMMARY:Ireland & Wales Travel Talk—a HYBRID event - Free Event
DESCRIPTION:📍 Ireland & Wales: Travel Talk\n🕑 Saturday\, May 16\, 2026 | 2:00–3:30 PM (ET)\n🎟 HYBRID EVENT – Attend In Person or Virtually\n🏢 In‑Person (max. 20 people) Location:\nExpedia Cruises East York agency office\n2035 Danforth Ave.\nToronto\, ON M4C 1J8\n________________________________________\n🎤 Featured Speaker\nDiego Perez\nBusiness Development Manager – Eastern Canada\nC.I.E. Tours\nDiego will share expert insights into two of Europe’s most captivating destinations\, offering inspiration and practical travel guidance to help you plan an unforgettable journey.\n________________________________________\n✨ What You’ll Discover\n✔️ Must‑see highlights and hidden gems\n✔️ Scenic coastlines and countryside escapes\n✔️ Local culture\, traditions\, and cuisine\n✔️ Ideal travel seasons and sample itineraries\n✔️ Guided tour insights from C.I.E. Tours\nPlus: A live Q&A—ask your Ireland & Wales travel questions!\n________________________________________\n✅ Save Your Spot\nWhether you join us in person at our Danforth location or virtually from home on Zoom\, this Travel Talk is perfect for anyone dreaming of Ireland or Wales.\n👉 Register here:\nhttps://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/95KPJPcIRoya60HpQkshWw\nSpace is limited—early registration is recommended.\n________________________________________\nWarm regards\,\nExpedia Cruises – East York Office\n2035 Danforth Ave.\nToronto\, ON M4C 1J8\n📞 647‑351‑6699
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/ireland-wales-travel-talk-a-hybrid-event-free-event/
LOCATION:Expedia Cruises\, 2035 Danforth Ave\, Toronto\, M4C 1J8
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/25003516/fb_Ig_ireland.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Expedia Cruises in East York (Danforth Ave)":MAILTO:eastyork@expediacruises.com
END:VEVENT
