SUMMARY:Spring Thaw Jazz Concert
DESCRIPTION:An evening of incredible music with a group of some of the finest musicians from Toronto’s jazz and folk scene. These include Julian Anderson-Bowes\, Leland Whitty\, Marta Solek\, Eric West\, Emily Schultz\, Tara Kannangara\, Chris Pruden and Benton Roark. Tickets $25 (or pay what you can). Proceeds go to support the work of BPC. For more info please visit the church website at www.beacheschurch.org or call 416-699-5871.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/spring-thaw-jazz-concert/
LOCATION:Beaches Presbyterian Church\, 65 Glen Manor Drive\, Toronto\, M4E 3V3
